# wiki-sap-mapping intermediate / cache artifact files. The agent writes
# into out/ during a pipeline run; Agency must NOT include any of these
# in the PR. The deliverable lives in wiki-sap-mapping/ instead.
out/

# Note: AAAP_CodeWiki/ is intentionally NOT listed here. The wiki is a
# Code Wiki backed by THIS repo at AAAP_CodeWiki/ on the main branch —
# its files are tracked content of AAAP_Code, not pipeline-generated
# temporary state. Writes are blocked at the agent layer (Safety Rules
# in wiki-sap-mapping.agent.md + the preToolUse hook in
# .github/hooks/scripts/pre-tool-guard.ps1), so the wiki cannot be
# modified by the agent even though git would otherwise notice changes.
